      "text": "Valganciclovir induction, 900 MG twice daily, was started only after the diagnostic result. Tacrolimus was continued at the recorded once-daily extended-release dose. Mycophenolate was not added, because it was not in the longitudinal record. Creatinine at that point was 0.9 mg/dL and later 0.8 mg/dL, within the range for the full induction dose.",
